sw: an EQ field drops every kind of cached result

Patch 0130 dropped the text and the DrawingML picture that Word writes
after an EQ field's separator, since Ely draws the field from its code.
Other kinds still came through (Ely R8.2): a nested field such as PAGE
or QUOTE, a DrawingML or VML text box or shape, a VML picture, an OMML
formula, an OLE object and a comment. Each was inserted beside the
formula.

Content inside an EQ field's result now goes the way content in a
discarded header or footer goes: nested fields close without inserting,
shapes are removed from the draw page, and pictures, OLE objects,
formulas and comments are not inserted. The paragraphs a nested field
held are still finished.
